        <p>Welcome to the Quickstart Page! This is where you can get started with the project.</p>
        <p>Follow these steps to get started:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Clone the repository from GitHub with this command: git clone https://github.com/markrockers7/DevOps-F26-Project.git</li>
